A pair of 3s is a marginal hand that benefits from keeping the pot small. Since the opponent checked, taking the free card is the safest play to realize equity without overcommitting chips to a board that hits the opponent's range (Kings, flush draws) harder than yours.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
