llows you to see the Flop and potentially improve your hand (e.g., hitting two pair, trips, or a straight draw) without investing any additional chips. Raising is risky and unnecessary with a poor hand out of position, and folding is a strategic error because checking costs you nothing.\n\nReason: You have the option to see the flop for free because the opponent only called. With a weak hand like 7-5 offsuit, checking is the optimal play to realize your equity without risk.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
